  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 843,
  "text_len": 8
 },
 {
  "id": "sce094:00369",
  "jp": "カスミ「ダメ。もしボタンがとれてなくなったら大変でしょ？{nl}　同じボタンってありそうでないのよ？」",
  "off": 873,
  "len": 56,
  "en": "Kasumi: No. It'd be a real problem if the button came off and got lost, right? You'd think you could find the same button, but you can't, you know?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 875,
  "text_len": 53
 },
 {
  "id": "sce094:003A4",
  "jp": "ヤマト「せっかくだから縫ってもらいニャさいよ。{nl}　今さら恥ずかしがることでもニャいでしょ？」",
  "off": 932,
  "len": 53,
  "en": "Yamato: Since she's offering, let her sew it, nya. It's nyot like you've got anything to be shy about by nyow, right?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 934,
  "text_len": 50
 },
